/**
 * @mainpage RoModular
 *
 * RoModular is a family of focused C++ repositories for portable software,
 * embedded systems, music theory, and music technology. This site is the
 * ecosystem-level map: it explains what each repository owns, how repositories
 * depend on one another, and which projects are stable, active, planned, or
 * retained only as legacy references.
 *
 * @section RoModularMainStart Start Here
 *
 * - @ref RoModular_Ecosystem_Overview explains the scope and ownership model.
 * - @ref RoModular_Ecosystem_Architecture shows the dependency boundaries.
 * - @ref RoModular_Repositories links every repository and its own documentation.
 * - @ref RoModular_Governance_Status defines current maturity and next steps.
 * - @ref RoModular_Governance_AIAgents explains the shared AI-agent contract.
 *
 * @section RoModularMainPrinciple One Portal, Independent Repositories
 *
 * This portal does not replace repository documentation. Each project remains
 * the source of truth for its API, build procedure, supported targets, tests,
 * packages, and releases. RoModular records only ecosystem-level ownership,
 * dependencies, compatibility, and navigation.
 */
